  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme juxtaposes two scenes: the first depicts a medieval knight claiming rights over his wife, implying a patriarchal, anti-women stance; the second shows a flag associated with conspiracy theories (often linked to anti-government or anti-establishment movements) with text that explicitly hates Freemasons and Christians. The overall intent is to promote hateful rhetoric against specific religious and political groups, using inflammatory language and imagery to incite division and hostility. The meme is designed to attack and dehumanize Christians and Freemasons, fitting the definition of hateful content as it directly targets individuals based on their religious affiliation and ideological beliefs.",
